    "decision-always-use-grapher": {
      "id": "decision-always-use-grapher",
      "type": "decision",
      "title": "Every repository change must use Grapher",
      "content": "Agents and humans must use the repository-supported Grapher mutation path for every substantive repository change. Hand-authored Grapher evidence or pass-record files are not a substitute for invoking Grapher. A valid change must mutate canonical .grapher/knowledge.json and append .grapher/history.jsonl through Grapher, then publish any required shared evidence.",
